A comment between a heading and a colon fence leaves the fence an opener

```
- a
  - b

    %%%
  # h
    %%%
    :::
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
    <h1 id="h">h</h1>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  # h
      %%%
      :::
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <h1 id="h">h</h1>
  </li>
</ul>
```
